*                                                                      *        
*  ELAINE              2020     KEEP TIBEGPAC FROM W47923B FILE FOR    *        
*                               DDGS ORDERS. FLDIRLEV = J.             *        
*                               PROGRAM W4798300 THAT CREATES          *        
*                               W47923B FILE FETCH CORRECT             *        
*                               TIBEGPAC FOR DDGS ORDERS FROM          *        
*                               DIRL-TISKEPPN-DDC IN WDQ211.           *        
*                                                                      *        
*  INGER STENING       210503   STORY 1941831 AZURE DATALAKE           *        
************************************************************************        
FILE WXTRA0D1.               * INFIL WDE4-INFO                                  
%W47923B 'E4-'                                                                  
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE WXTRA0D2.               * INFIL WDR1-INFO                                  
%W47990  'R1-'                                                                  
